        "Description": "Congratulations on passing the first stage of the Agent Requalification Program\r\rAs you know, some clients want to send a message, often requesting specific and highly brutal methods of execution. Several of our agents struggle to maintain our standarts when fulfilling  such contracts, particularly when targets are difficult to approach.\rThis exercise has been designed to evaluate your ability to perform such executions cleanly.\r\rCreative maneuvering and tricks and may be required.\r\rGood luck 47",
